# The variables this example reads. Copy to .env, fill in, then load it into your shell
# with `set -a; . ./.env; set +a` — the script reads the environment, not this file.
# .env is excluded by .gitignore — never commit a real connection string; it grants read
# access to your consumer's telemetry stream.
#
# Portal -> Partners -> <your partner> -> <your consumer> -> Event Hubs
#        -> Primary Connection String
#
# This is the only value the example needs. The hub name travels inside the connection
# string as EntityPath.
BDP_EVENTHUB_CONNECTION_STRING=
